Ported components (worker/src/normalize.ts):
  - vigobusapi/vigobus_getters/http/http_parser.py  → parseEstimaciones
  - vigobusapi/vigobus_getters/string_fixes.py      → fixBus, fixMojibake
    (LINE_LETTERS, CHARS_FIXED tables)
  - vigobusapi/vigobus_getters/helpers.py           → arrival ordering
  - vigobusapi/vigobus_getters/html/html_parser.py  → duplicate removal

Modifications: ported from Python to TypeScript; typed wire contract; eta
computed as generatedAt + minutes; drop-rule for empty destinations and
out-of-range minutes; stop-not-exist surfaced as a contract error code.

